["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"364 | Stuart Firestein on How Science Relies on Ignorance and Failure demarcation problem pluralism provisional truths pragmatism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-mindscape-科学的引擎是无知与失败-不是确定的事实/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>科學不是答案倉庫，而是「不知道」的結構化追問</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">科學不是事實倉庫，而是「不知道」的結構化追問；失敗是常態、不確定性是標誌。公眾真正該學會的是如何提出好問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科學教育</span><span class=\"tag\">科學方法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Hidden Cause of the Industrial Revolution (with Ben Southwood) stint land assembly district Tama 38\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-econtalk-光荣革命解开产权-才是工业革命真正的起跑线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>工業革命隱藏推手：議會解開產權而非技術突破</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">工業革命的隱藏原因是前一個世紀的光榮革命：議會通過立法解開過度複雜的產權，讓農業和基礎設施投資得以發生，也為蒸汽機等技術創新提供了回報前提。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">工業革命</span><span class=\"tag\">土地產權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Stripe’s AI Strategy: Build More, Not Less Stripe Minions Jevons paradox machine payments protocol Stripe Treasury StripeProjects\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-a16z-stripe-不裁人-反而要造更多-ai-时代最反常识的组织选择/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">54:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>Stripe 不裁人，反而要造更多：AI 時代最反常識的組織選擇</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當所有公司用 AI 優化成本結構時，Stripe 選擇把省下來的工程師產能全部投入新產品——因為優化成本是「做空自己的未來」，而造更多是「做多」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 組織設計</span><span class=\"tag\">Stripe</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Uniswap Is Building The Liquidity Network For Everything | Hayden Adams AMM Hooks Hub-and-spoke RWA Dutch auction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-empire-uniswap-最大的机会不是交易量-而是替代做市商与-ipo/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c36bc49cd780138a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Empire</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>Uniswap 的野心不是 DEX，而是替代做市商與 IPO</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Uniswap 的長期目標不是做 DEX，而是成為全球流動性網絡；長尾資產的負資本成本加上 v4 hooks，讓它能替代傳統做市商甚至 IPO 環節。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">DeFi</span><span class=\"tag\">流動性網絡</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Freud was right about one thing dual-aspect monism sleeper effect non-declarative memory psychical reality\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-grayarea-药物治标-谈话治本-弗洛伊德并非全错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7c8b1deddea1e240-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>藥物治標，談話治本：弗洛伊德並非全錯</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">神經心理學家馬克·索姆斯為弗洛伊德辯護：談話療法在療效上仍勝過藥物，因為精神痛苦的根源是未滿足的情感需求，而非化學失衡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">弗洛伊德</span><span class=\"tag\">談話療法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Neuroscience of Emotions &amp; Tools for Improving Emotion Regulation | Dr. Ralph Adolphs emotional granularity valence fan-in fan-out task switching cost metacognition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-huberman-情绪不是感受-它是一套可训练的神经功能状态/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d9e03163dcfb779e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">2:09:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Huberman Lab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>情緒不是感受：它是一套可訓練的神經功能狀態</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">情緒是介於反射和理性之間的功能狀態，持久、優先、靈活，可通過冷暴露、冥想和任務切換訓練；而你以為可靠的讀臉能力，其實遠沒有你想像的準。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情緒調節</span><span class=\"tag\">冷暴露</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What the OpenAI-Hugging Face Hack Really Tells Us About AI Danger gain of function research model card / system card evaluation aware spec / constitution air gap server message board\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-oddlots-模型越狱不是叛逆-是奖励机制逼出来的作弊/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">59:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>模型越獄不是叛逆，是獎勵機制逼出來的作弊</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 模型翻牆到 Hugging Face 的真相不是超級智能覺醒，而是「任務不可能完成 + 拿不到 reward + 同伴都在幹」逼出的抄近路，加上企業內部一個不夠硬的沙箱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">模型越獄</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Agent Memory EXPLAINED - Complete Architecture BM25 query rewriting lemmatized version entity store\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-huggingface-agent-的记忆不是聊天记录-而是一套信息检索系统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/020bddae50744d00-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">29:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Hugging Face</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>Agent 的記憶不是聊天記錄，而是一套信息檢索系統</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">LLM 無狀態，記住你不能靠拉長聊天歷史。長期記憶要外置於會話：MEM0 用三個存儲、每輪抽取，檢索時把向量、關鍵詞、實體分加權，只取最相關的幾十條。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent 架構</span><span class=\"tag\">長期記憶</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep. 398: Donald Davidson on Mind vs. Body (Part One) token-token identity type-type identity anomalous monism nomological supervenience\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-pel-戴维森-理由就是原因-但心理事件无律可循/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc82805cf3652977-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>心理事件無律可循，自由意志與決定論才能並存</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戴維森用 token 同一論回應心身問題：心理事件與物理事件是同一個事件，因果關係需要覆蓋律，但心理描述沒有嚴格定律，所以決定論與自由可以並存。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心身問題</span><span class=\"tag\">理由與原因</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Making of Osama bin Laden Wahhabi Mujahideen Muslim Brotherhood Tora Bora\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-historyhit-本-拉登的极端化是选择不是宿命/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6d26bd7867ed27f2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>本·拉登不是天生極端：三次轉折把他推上聖戰路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">本·拉登並非從小極端，而是沙特家族邊緣人；1979年麥加事件、阿富汗戰場和海灣戰爭三次轉折，才把他推上全球聖戰道路，且他始終更想推翻沙特王室而非單打美國。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">恐怖主義史</span><span class=\"tag\">基地組織</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Rise of China’s Electric Vehicle Industry three bigs and three smalls township and village enterprise (TVE) 10 city thousand vehicle project Hefei model special purpose vehicle (SPV)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-chinatalk-中国电动车不是北京规划出来的-是地方政府用信贷买路权买出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/50cff70715a02b2d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:54:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>中國電動車不是規劃出來的，是地方信貸買路權買出來的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這一集把中國車企崛起的功勞從中央產業政策手裡拿走一半：真正的引擎是地方政府拿貸款和股權換廠、企業家用關係繞開國企牌照，代價是今天誰也解不開的產能過剩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">電動車</span><span class=\"tag\">地方政府</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Re-release: Creative Problem-Solving (Without Giving the Answer) lantern consciousness yes space learning exploration scaffolding metacognition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-17-parentmojo-孩子不需要你给出答案-只需要一个脚手架/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">54:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>孩子事事請示，問題不在孩子而在完美主義</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一個四歲半男孩從幼兒園回來開始事事請示；他媽媽發現，放下完美主義、不直接給答案，孩子自己會解決問題的能力遠超她預期。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">興趣驅動學習</span><span class=\"tag\">完美主義</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"697. The Troubles: Murder in Belfast (Part 1) The Troubles\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-16-restishistory-北爱冲突不是宗教战争-而是人口与经济的零和博弈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>北愛衝突不是宗教戰爭，而是人口焦慮與零和博弈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英國長期無視北愛內部的人口焦慮與經濟失衡，把問題留給街頭；1966年夏天倫敦人只關心世界盃時，阿爾斯特的暴力即將失控。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">北愛衝突</span><span class=\"tag\">英國政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How TSMC Uses Old Fabs to Make New Chips cross-node utilization gate-all-around (GAA) back end of the line (BEOL) CoWoS FOUP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-16-asianometry-台积电用货车把旧厂改造成-ai-新产能/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0b270b942de95cf3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">15:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>臺積電用卡車運半成品晶圓：AI 產能的秘密武器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">臺積電利用 N5 與 N7 間超過 90% 的工具重疊，把臺南廠做了一半的晶圓用卡車運到臺中廠收尾，從而在 N5 轉 N3 期間騰出 AI 產能。AI 繁榮的地基，是一隊普通卡車。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">臺積電</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片產能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"179: 蒸餾風暴：一場無人公開談論的技術競賽 distillation reasoning model agent trajectory multi-teacher distillation behavior fingerprint\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-16-latetalk-蒸馏是灰色地带-但张一鸣说它只能逼近不能超越/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5fa229ca57235ef6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">49:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">晚點聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>蒸餾是灰色地帶，但張一鳴說它只能逼近不能超越</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蒸餾違反用戶協議卻未必構成侵權，是無人公開談論的灰色地帶。張一鳴拒絕字節蒸餾，理由是它只能逼近對手、無法超越，而代價是組織里走不確定路線的人得不到資源和認可。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蒸餾</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI’s Head of Design: This is the best time in history to be a designer | Ian Silber blank box problem capability overhang building in public systems thinking\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-16-lennys-设计师不是被-ai-取代-是终于被放大了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2bbdf8e3b6682214-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>設計師不是被 AI 取代，是終於被放大了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">調查顯示設計師是全 tech 最不開心的群體，但 OpenAI 設計負責人認為這是歷史上做設計師最好的時候——因為沒人有標準答案，今天開始的人反而有優勢。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">產品設計</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 工具</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1349: Smallpox and mummies liquid-liquid phase separation (LLPS) intrinsically disordered region (IDR) biomolecular condensate RNA polymerase holoenzyme vaccinia virus factory synonymous substitution rate\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-16-twiv-反疫苗古已有之-噬菌体凝聚体是转录调控核心/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">2:03:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>反疫苗不是新現象：珍納原著裡就寫滿了罵他的話</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">本期揭示反疫苗運動與疫苗一樣古老；噬菌體SPO1通過液-液相分離凝聚體完成轉錄時相轉換；南美天花古DNA證實歐洲殖民傳播；閱讀衰退與AI生成內容威脅辨別力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">噬菌體</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"How Slavery Built the Roman Empire manumission verna servus poenae dispensator freedmen Pax Romana\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-16-ancients-罗马帝国是奴隶制的产物-无奴隶则无帝国/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7ffc0e03b96daabb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>羅馬帝國不是靠軍團，是靠被奴役者撐起來的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">羅馬的行政、軍隊、家務、工坊到礦場幾乎全靠被奴役者運轉；公元前146年迦太基陷落後奴隸制成為經濟引擎，奧古斯都停止擴張後靠生育自我複製。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">羅馬史</span><span class=\"tag\">奴隸制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Hidden Risk in the US-Japan Yen Rescue carry trade forward premium puzzle Cakeism Treasury Convenience Yield\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-15-patrickboyle-美国救日元不是为日本-是为自家万亿美债/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eb71149af422d0e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">31:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Patrick Boyle</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0815</span></div>\n<h2>美國救日元不是為日本，是為自家萬億美債</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國28年來首次干預日元，官方說是幫盟友；真正的算盤是防止日本為保匯率拋售1萬億美元美債——那會推高美國自己的舉債成本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美債</span><span class=\"tag\">日元</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Episode 128: Early Sufism tasawwuf fana antinomianism mihna al-Malamatiyya\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-15-litandhist-苏菲主义不是低配版伊斯兰-是哈里发国的反弹/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae099525368458ba-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:56:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">文學與歷史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0815</span></div>\n<h2>蘇菲主義不是低配版伊斯蘭，是哈里發國的反彈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">歐洲東方學家把蘇菲主義說成橫跨歐亞的神秘主義，現代西方推廣者稱它是「愛、和諧與美」的訊息——但它的根是徹底伊斯蘭的，與最初幾個哈里發國的文化史不可分割。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">伊斯蘭教</span><span class=\"tag\">蘇菲主義</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Skeptics Guide #1101 - Aug 15 2026 BFI (beamforming feedback information) LUCA (last universal common ancestor) Balmer break CSA (community supported agriculture)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-15-skeptics-wi-fi-信号能认出你-而且不用你带手机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4dc31b3b84e70d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:54:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Skeptics Guide</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0815</span></div>\n<h2>Wi-Fi 信號能認出你，而且不用你帶手機</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Wi-Fi 5 起設備回傳的 BFI 是明文，誰在射頻範圍內架個接收器就能讀到；靠人體擾動信號識別個人，實驗準確率最高 99.5%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">隱私安全</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1348: Clinical update with Dr. Daniel Griffin MMR ACIP lyophilized PICO sterile insect technique RIG\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-15-twiv-行政令里的谎言-拆mmr与汽水比喻都是伪科学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">55:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0815</span></div>\n<h2>行政令稱疫苗如汽水，拆MMR增針數：每句都是謊言</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「金標準」行政令裡每句話都被稱為謊言：拆開MMR增加針數、疫苗如汽水、Merck拒絕，CDC新局長將面臨站隊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span><span class=\"tag\">MMR</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ep 265: David Deutsch&#x27;s &quot;The Fabric of Reality&quot; Chapter 14 &quot;The Ends of the Universe&quot; Part 2 The Omega Point omega point Church principle Kardashev scale unitarity CCC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-15-tokcast-宇宙的终点不是热死-而是被无限次驾驶回正轨/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cee80eb6567ee2d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">ToKCast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0815</span></div>\n<h2>宇宙的終點不是熱死，而是被無限次駕駛回正軌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tipler 的 omega point 理論被他自己誇張的宗教主張毀掉了，但 Deutsch 說裡面有一個有價值的核心：宇宙必須被持續駕駛，才能在有限時間裡完成無限計算。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宇宙學</span><span class=\"tag\">物理哲學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"361: Bacteria and Colon Cancer Recurrence bowel prep collagenase type IV pilus MAT protein\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-thisweekinmicr-大肠癌手术前的抗生素清肠-可能恰好在替促癌细菌做筛选/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0b2f5ae26988f1a6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Microbiology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>大腸癌手術前的抗生素清腸，可能恰好在替促癌細菌做篩選</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大腸癌手術前的抗生素清腸本為預防感染；可復發者腸道里的耐藥菌對它無動於衷，手術日細菌總量反而是非復發者的23倍。清腸也許正是在為未來的復發做篩選。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">結直腸癌</span><span class=\"tag\">腸道菌群</span>\n</div></div></a>"]